	(text "VREF_TGT comes from the target on J13.1 / J15.1 and sets the level of every translator (TXB0104/TXB0108/TXS0102)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 19.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "529f5fec-1861-4afb-8304-87233f967e48")
	)
	(text "OE pins follow VREF_TGT: with the target off the translators are high-impedance. J15 GPIO are push-pull (TXB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 22.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f1ee353-d76a-4a7e-b68b-7a69daa56996")
	)
	(text "TXS0102 instead of PCA9306: works with VREF_TGT equal to 3.3 V (PCA9306 needs VREF2 > VREF1). Range 1.65-3.6 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 25.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5093536f-825e-439d-86b5-6622458666ce")
	)
	(text "TPS26630: ILIM 3.65k -> ~5 A, UVLO 196k/75k -> 4.3 V, OVP/MODE/PGTH to GND (latch-off). IMON 20k -> 2.8 V at 5 A into PTB2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 27.8 0)
		(effects
